# DeckDNA configuration
#
# Copy this file to .env only when you want the optional Google Gemini
# features. The deterministic core (parse, learn, generate, critique,
# export) needs no key and never contacts a network.
#
# The key below enables the opt-in vision and LLM features only:
#   - vision style enrichment (--use-vision on scripts/extract_style.py)
#   - the visual critic (--use-vision with --critique)
#   - LLM outline/content drafting (--use-llm)
# Free tier key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
